    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="24">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 24</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="24" corresp="#wit-d-incomplete">And fæste man ælce Frigedæg, buton hit freols sy.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="24" corresp="#wit-k">⁊ fæste man ælce Frigedæg, butan hit freols sy.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k">And fæste man ælce Frigedæge butan hit freols sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-k">And a fast [shall be observed] every Friday, unless it be a festival.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k">And there shall be a fast each Friday unless it is a feast.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und man faste jeden Freitag, ausser wenn es ein Fest ist.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And let there be fasting every Friday, unless it is a feast-day.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="253"><ref target="clause:VAtr_17">V Atr 17</ref></note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">ebd. 17</note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#liebermann"><ref target="clause:ICn_16a">I Cn 16a</ref></note>
      </div>
